<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %> <% style="about" %>

<header>
  <div class="headerFirst">
    <p class="heading">About IntelliPhoenix</p>
    <p class="subheading">A smarter step towards a healthier tomorrow.</p>
    <div class="about">
      IntelliPhoenix is an AI-powered healthcare platform designed to make
      <br />
      healthcare more accessible, efficient, and patient-centric. Our goal is to
      <br />
      use artificial intelligence to assist users in understanding their
      symptoms,
      <br />
      providing possible health insights, suggesting appropriate medical
      specialists, <br />
      and simplifying appointment booking &mdash; all in one place
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="headerSecond">
    <img src="assests/aboutHeroSection.png" class="headerLogo" />
  </div>
</header>

<div class="gapping"></div>

<button id="topBtn">&uparrow;</button>

<main class="mainContent">
  <section class="secCon">
    <div class="workIcon">
      <div class="stepLogo sL sLColor step-Card">
        <img src="assests/vision.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="workDescription">
        <b>Our Vision</b>
        <p>
          A healthier society <br />
          through technology.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="horizontalLine"></div>

    <div class="workIcon">
      <div class="stepLogo sL sLColor step-Card">
        <img src="assests/mission.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="workDescription">
        <b>Our Mission</b>
        <p>
          To make quality healthcare <br />
          accessible to everyone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="horizontalLine"></div>

    <div class="workIcon">
      <div class="stepLogo sL sLColor step-Card">
        <img src="assests/values.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="workDescription">
        <b>Our Values</b>
        <p>
          Trust, Innovation, <br />
          Care and Privacy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="horizontalLine"></div>

    <div class="workIcon">
      <div class="stepLogo sL sLColor step-Card">
        <img src="assests/commit.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="workDescription">
        <b>Our Commitment</b>
        <p>
          Your health and privacy <br />
          always come first.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="countersDir">
    <div class="wholeCounter">
      <div class="counterLogo-1 cL">
        <img src="assests/patient.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="counter">
        <h2 class="count" data-target="2500">0</h2>
        <p>Patients</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wholeCounter">
      <div class="counterLogo-2 cL">
        <img src="assests/Doctor.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="counter">
        <h2 class="count" data-target="120">0</h2>
        <p>Doctors</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wholeCounter">
      <div class="counterLogo-3 cL">
        <img src="assests/Appointment.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="counter">
        <h2 class="count" data-target="850">0</h2>
        <p>Appointments</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wholeCounter">
      <div class="counterLogo-4 cL">
        <img src="assests/Accuracy.png" class="counter-img" />
      </div>
      <div class="counter">
        <h2 class="count" data-target="95">0</h2>
        <p>Accuracy</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p>
    Healthcare is one of the most important sectors in modern society, where
    efficient patient management and timely medical assistance play a
    significant role in improving healthcare services. Traditional healthcare
    systems often rely on manual appointment handling and paper-based record
    management, which can lead to delays, inefficiency, and communication
    problems between patients and healthcare providers.
  </p>
  <p>
    With the rapid growth of digital technologies and artificial intelligence,
    healthcare services are gradually shifting towards smart and automated
    systems. AI-based healthcare applications help improve accessibility, reduce
    manual workload, and provide preliminary assistance to users through
    intelligent automation and data processing.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Web Application, <b>“IntelliPhoenix”</b> is designed to provide a smart
    healthcare platform that integrates appointment management with AI-assisted
    symptom guidance. Based on the symptoms provided by the user, the
    application generates AI-assisted responses such as possible health
    concerns, severity levels, specialist recommendations, and basic
    precautions.
  </p>
  <p>
    The primary objective of this Application is to simplify healthcare
    appointment management and improve preliminary healthcare assistance through
    automation, intelligent response generation, and digital record management.
    The system is intended to enhance healthcare accessibility while reducing
    manual effort and improving user experience.
  </p>

  <p>
    The <b>“IntelliPhoenix”</b> is a smart healthcare management system designed
    to improve the efficiency of appointment handling and provide preliminary
    AI-assisted symptom guidance to patients. The system aims to simplify
    communication between patients and healthcare providers through digital
    automation and intelligent assistance.
  </p>
  <p>
    The application allows users to register, login, book appointments, manage
    schedules, and enter symptoms through an interactive web interface. Based on
    the symptoms provided by the user, the system generates AI-assisted
    responses such as possible health concerns, severity levels, recommended
    specialists, and basic precautions. The application also includes separate
    dashboards for patients, doctors, and administrators for efficient
    management of healthcare-related activities.
  </p>

  <br />

  <div class="disclaimer">
    &ast; Disclaimer: The AI responses generated by the system are informational
    only and do not replace professional medical diagnosis or consultation.
  </div>
</main>

<script src="/js/about.js"></script>
